        <p>This site is independently operated and has no official affiliation with the Federal Board of Intermediate and Secondary Education. Practice scores are estimates for revision. Questions, labels and study tips can contain errors or differ from your school’s scheme, syllabus updates, or current examination instructions.</p>
        <p>For official requirements, use the <a href="@McqExam.WebAPI.PublicStudyCatalog.Frameworks">FBISE assessment frameworks and model papers</a>. <a href="/contact">Report a correction</a> if you find a problem.</p>
